  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We know&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2023</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>289</mn></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>2021</mn></mfenced><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2022</mn></mfenced><mn>2021</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2023</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2023</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2021</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2021</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>674</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>674</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>This is a multiple of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Hence, remainder is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
